b=section('2  System Architecture','CODE PATHS / TRUST BOUNDARIES','Architecture is reconstructed from Cargo metadata, binary entrypoints and inspected runtime configuration. Solid boxes represent code/wiring; they do not mean successful execution. Dashed boxes mark disconnected or proposed paths. All diagrams are reusable SVG/PDF assets in assets/.')
